OL,3,AJudge allows Trump's $10bn defamation
OL,4,Acase against BBC to proceed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA federal judge in Florida has allowed
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump's defamation
OL,8,Fcase against the BBC to go ahead after
OL,9,Fthe broadcaster sought to dismiss it.
OL,11,FBut Judge Jeffrey Kuntz dismissed a
OL,12,Fsecond claim in the $10bn (#7.5bn)
OL,13,Flawsuit under the state's unfair trade
OL,14,Fpractices law.
OL,16,FThe US president is suing the BBC over
OL,17,Fan episode of Panorama that edited
OL,18,Ftogether two different sections of a
OL,19,Fspeech he gave before the riot at the
OL,20,FUS Capitol in 2021.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
