OL,3,AJudge allows Trump's $10bn defamation
OL,4,Acase against BBC to proceed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump called the judge's ruling a "huge
OL,7,Fvictory" in a Truth Social post on
OL,8,FTuesday. A BBC spokesperson said: "We
OL,9,Fare surprised by this decision but
OL,10,Frespect the Court's authority and note
OL,11,Fthe case will now proceed to the next
OL,12,Fstage."
